data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `object-tracking` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/object-tracking/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/object-tracking/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/object-tracking /mnt/user-data/workspace/object-tracking\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\ndetections = {\"detections\":[\n  {\"frame_id\":\"frame_001\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\",\"objects\":[{\"object_id\":\"det_001\",\"label\":\"person\",\"confidence\":0.91,\"bbox\":[100,100,180,260]}]},\n  {\"frame_id\":\"frame_002\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\",\"objects\":[{\"object_id\":\"det_002\",\"label\":\"person\",\"confidence\":0.89,\"bbox\":[120,105,200,265]}]}\n]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/object-tracking/detections.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(detections, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/object-tracking/scripts/run.py --detections-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/object-tracking/detections.json --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/object-tracking/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/object-tracking/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"65e944a0-7631-4bec-b82a-426ae2676242"},{"content":"我将按照您的要求严格执行测试流程。\n\n首先读取 SKILL.md 文件：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":119,"prompt_tokens":9237,"total_tokens":9356,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":40,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":119},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9237}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-722f5f2f-ad62-9ced-ba94-14267c38056e","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e628f-c498-77b0-846f-ea9f13905f9b-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 object-tracking skill 的 SKILL.md 文件","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/object-tracking/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_765980ac95354ed6a578006b","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9237,"output_tokens":119,"total_tokens":9356,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":40}}},{"content":"---\nname: object-tracking\ndescription: Track detected objects across video frames and return Track schema for object analytics only. Use when Codex has frame-level detections and needs stable track ids, trajectories, duration, last bbox, movement state, confidence, and evidence frame ids. Do not use this skill to infer video events or abnormal behavior.\n---\n\n# Object Tracking\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf `detections` are missing but the user provided frames or a video, call upstream skills in order: `frame-sampling/scripts/run.py` when frames are missing, then `object-detection/scripts/run.py`, then this skill. Use only object labels, not event labels.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython object-tracking/scripts/run.py --detections-json <detections.json> --camera-id <camera_id> --config <config.json> --output <tracks.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--detections-json`, `--camera-id`, `--association-distance-pixels`, `--stationary-distance-pixels`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Sort detections by timestamp.\n2. Associate same-label detections across frames.\n3. Build track trajectory, start/end times, duration, last bbox, and confidence.\n4. Classify movement state as stationary or moving.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `camera_id`\n- `detections`\n- Optional `tracks` to pass through precomputed tracks\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `tracks`, each with `track_id`, `label`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `duration_seconds`, `trajectory`, `movement_state`, `confidence`, `last_bbox`, and `evidence_frame_ids`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\nThe current implementation tolerates empty detections and returns an empty track list.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not apply ROI rules, infer anomalies, or emit event candidates.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"3a9f1c62-b212-451c-8695-f827c7083565","tool_call_id":"call_765980ac95354ed6a578006b","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行您提供的 bash 命令：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":383,"prompt_tokens":9832,"total_tokens":10215,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":383},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9832}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-90534687-af03-971d-a2e5-a94875020b70","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e628f-eeb1-7b20-92cc-695511e735ae-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 object-tracking skill 的测试命令，创建目录、生成 detections.json 并运行 tracking 脚本","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs